# {{name}}

A [fudic](https://github.com/fudiePlatform/fudic) workspace: several apps and the libraries they
share, in one repo.

- `apps/`: what you serve. Each app has its pages and its own base URL: the first one is at `/`,
  the others at `/<name>/`.
- `libs/`: components your apps use. A library is not served.

```sh
pnpm dev        # every app on one port, each under its base URL
pnpm preview    # the same, with each app's build
pnpm build      # build every app into its own dist/
pnpm test       # unit tests of every project
pnpm spec       # .fudspec criteria of every project, in a browser
```

One app on its own: `pnpm --filter <app> dev`.

## Add to it

- `fudic g lib ui`: a component library.
- `fudic g app admin --uses ui`: another app, at `/admin/`, that uses it.
- `fudic add ui --project {{app}}`: make an app you have use a library.
- `fudic g component button --project ui`: `<ui-button>`, with its test and spec.
